  "translation": "This afternoon, my mom and I went to the supermarket together. First, we went to the fruit section. There were many apples and bananas. Mom asked me, 'What fruit do you want to eat?' I said, 'I want to eat apples.' Mom asked, 'How much are the apples per jin?' The fruit seller said, 'Three yuan per jin.' Mom looked at the apples and said, 'These apples are very fresh.' Mom knows how to pick fruit. She bought three apples, spent nine yuan in total, and then we went to the vegetable section. In the vegetable section, we bought cabbage and tomatoes, and finally we went to the meat section. Mom bought a piece of beef. We spent fifty-five yuan in total. We were all very happy and went home."
